#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House3/scripts.inc:33
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House3_Text_WillingToTradeIt"
msgid ""
"Check out this {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"It's the {STR_VAR_2} that I caught\n"
"yesterday to celebrate my birthday!\p"
"Oh, I can see that you want it!\n"
"After all, it's priceless!\p"
"I'll tell you what. I might be willing\n"
"to trade it for a {STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"看看这只{STR_VAR_2}！\p"
"这是我昨天为了庆祝生日\n"
"抓到的{STR_VAR_2}！\p"
"哦，我看得出你很想要！\n"
"毕竟它可是无价之宝！\p"
"这样吧。用{STR_VAR_1}来换的话，\n"
"我也许可以考虑。$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House3/scripts.inc:42
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House3_Text_ItsSubtlyDifferentThankYou"
msgid ""
"Oh, so this is a {STR_VAR_1}?\p"
"It's sort of like a {STR_VAR_2},\n"
"and yet it's subtly different.\p"
"Thank you!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，这就是{STR_VAR_1}吗？\p"
"它有点像{STR_VAR_2}，\n"
"但又有微妙的不同。\p"
"谢谢你！$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House3/scripts.inc:48
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House3_Text_WontAcceptAnyLessThanRealMon"
msgid ""
"No, no, no! I won't accept any\n"
"less than a real {STR_VAR_1}!$"
msgstr ""
"不不不！不是真正的\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}我可不要！$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House3/scripts.inc:52
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House3_Text_NotDesperateOrAnything"
msgid ""
"Oh, so you're not going to go through\n"
"with this?\p"
"That's cool. I'm not desperate to make\n"
"a trade or anything.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你不打算交换了吗？\p"
"没关系。我也不是\n"
"非交换不可。$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House3/scripts.inc:58
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House3_Text_ReallyWantedToGetBagon"
msgid ""
"I know I could go looking for one\n"
"on my own, but…\p"
"But I really wanted to get a BAGON\n"
"that another TRAINER caught…$"
msgstr ""
"我知道我可以自己去找，\n"
"但是……\p"
"但是我真的很想要一只\n"
"别的训练家抓到的宝贝龙……$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House3/scripts.inc:64
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House3_Text_IsThatAPokedex"
msgid ""
"Is that a POKéDEX?\p"
"Did you get to meet a lot of different\n"
"POKéMON?\p"
"I wish I was like you.$"
msgstr ""
"那是宝可梦图鉴吗？\p"
"你见过很多\n"
"不同的宝可梦吗？\p"
"真希望我能像你一样。$"
